return section("Help & Feedback","Tell the CARE & CTRL team what is broken, confusing or worth improving.")+"<div class=\"dashboard-grid\"><article class=\"panel\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">DIRECT FEEDBACK</p><h2>Something not right?</h2><p class=\"panel-copy\">Report a bug, request a feature, or tell us where the workflow became confusing.</p><form id=\"feedbackForm\"><div class=\"form-grid\"><div class=\"field\"><label>CATEGORY</label><select name=\"category\"><option>Bug</option><option>Data quality</option><option>Feature request</option><option>UX / design</option><option>Other</option></select></div><div class=\"field\"><label>PAGE</label><input name=\"page\" value=\""+esc(titles[S.view]||S.view)+"\" readonly></div></div><div class=\"field\"><label>WHAT SHOULD WE IMPROVE?</label><textarea name=\"message\" rows=\"6\" placeholder=\"Tell us what happened, what you expected, and what would make it better…\" required></textarea></div><button class=\"button primary\" type=\"submit\">Send feedback →</button></form><div id=\"feedbackResult\"></div></article></div>"
